<!-- Teaching layer over exact approved source fb8354e. -->
<!-- @opening -->
<p class="story-lead">A server certificate rotates successfully, yet an older installed app loses every connection. The trust chain is valid; the app’s extra pin restriction is now the failure boundary.</p>

<!-- @before 5. Pin Rotation: The Two-Pin Rule :: animation -->
### The backup must reach the old cohort first

